### Topic 67 - sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
### Works the same whether the app runs with mvn spring-boot:run or docker compose up.

### Which database are we using? (H2 on the laptop, MySQL inside Compose)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/where

### List all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Add a book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Docker Deep Dive",
  "author": "Nigel Poulton"
}

### Health check (the same URL Docker's healthcheck calls)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
